It says we must go through the Valley of Incineration, over Undertaker Ridge, through the Cave of Lost Souls... The forest around them magically readjusts, conforming to the map. Rocks, trees and topography shift, revealing a FRIGHTENING LANDSCAPE: valleys of fire, avalanche battered canyons, mountaintops lanced by lightning bolts...
